flowchart LR
    A[Android Business app] -->|Encrypted bounded projection, drafts and pending commands| L[(Local device store)]
    A -->|Authorized API and sync| API[Ubi API and workers]
    W[Customer web/app] -->|Public or scoped API| API

    API -->|Owner transactions| PG[(Managed PostgreSQL)]
    PG -->|Transactional outbox| P[Projectors and processors]
    P -->|Rebuildable documents| S[(PostgreSQL or future search)]
    P -->|Versioned safe data| C[(Optional cache / public CDN)]

    API -->|Create authorized upload session| O[(Private object storage)]
    O -->|Verified event| P
    PG -->|Object ownership and lifecycle metadata| O

    API -->|Use, do not own master keys| K[Secret manager and KMS]
    P -->|Scoped provider credentials| K

    C -. never owner truth .-> PG
    S -. reauthorize and hydrate .-> API
    L -. sync commands and versions .-> API
